---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "collection - lucid vagary"
permalink: /collection/
---
<section class="posts-section">
  <h1 class="posts-title">collection</h1>
  <p class="posts-intro">Collections bring works together through deliberate curatorial groupings, including <a href="/posts/The-Pentaptych-of-Growth/">The Pentaptych of Growth</a>. They offer a considered path through the work; <a href="/constellations/" class="archive-link">constellations</a> trace connections that can cross those groupings. Browse the <a href="/archive/" class="archive-link">complete archive</a> for all artwork and writing.</p>

  <div class="posts-list">
    {% for post in collections.anchorWorks %}
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-card" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}">
      {% if post.data.image %}
      <div class="listing-card-image">
        {% optimizedImage post.data.image, "", "card", "lazy" %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="post-card-body">
        {% if post.data.tags %}
        <div class="post-tags-mini">
          {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
          <span class="post-tag-mini">{{ tag }}</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="post-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
        {% if post.data.description %}
        <p class="post-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
